选择，不能只按名称近似替换。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 1050, "text": "V10 · 2026-10-12  |  基于基础设计规范 V09 · 浅色桌面工作区", "size": 12, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 1250, "y": 1050, "text": "06 / 07", "size": 12, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 84, "y": 322, "text": "任务", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 84, "y": 347, "text": "task", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 308, "y": 322, "text": "智能体", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 308, "y": 347, "text": "agent", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 532, "y": 322, "text": "侧栏切换", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 532, "y": 347, "text": "sidebar", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 756, "y": 322, "text": "搜索", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 756, "y": 347, "text": "search", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 980, "y": 322, "text": "Skill", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 980, "y": 347, "text": "skills", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 1204, "y": 322, "text": "新增项目", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 1204, "y": 347, "text": "folder-add", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 84, "y": 500, "text": "编辑", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 84, "y": 525, "text": "edit", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 308, "y": 500, "text": "Agent 集群", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 308, "y": 525, "text": "cluster", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 532, "y": 500, "text": "默认权限", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 532, "y": 525, "text": "shield-check", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 756, "y": 500, "text": "添加", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 756, "y": 525, "text": "plus", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 980, "y": 500, "text": "导出", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 980, "y": 525, "text": "custom-063-gtn", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 1204, "y": 500, "text": "文件 / 库示例", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 1204, "y": 525, "text": "file-text", "size": 11, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 638, "text": "尺寸与编辑方式", "size": 20, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 685, "text": "常规导航槽：20px；输入工具：15–17px；资源 viewBox 保持原样。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 720, "text": "先看可见路径边界与视觉中心，再调整外框；不要把不同图标强行统一线宽。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 755, "text": "填充型路径：编辑轮廓；真实 stroke：可编辑描边。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 790, "text": "保留 fill=\"none\" 与填充规则；丢失根节点属性会导致线性图标变成实心。", "size": 14, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 800, "y": 638, "text": "不要混用", "size": 20, "color": "#333333", "weight": 600, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 930, "y": 706, "text": "加号 ≠ 带圈加号", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 854, "y": 771, "text": "滑杆 ≠ 两个左圆点的任务列表", "size": 14, "color": "#333333", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 800, "y": 831, "text": "截图描摹版不再作为新稿默认素材。", "size": 13, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 800, "y": 860, "text": "头像、金币、品牌图标可保留位图，须列明。", "size": 13, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 800, "y": 889, "text": "场景原生 PNG 不自动描边冒充原始 SVG。", "size": 13, "color": "#777777", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}, {"x": 64, "y": 970, "text": "素材：V06 原生图标库；V07 三枚补充图标。此页仅演示选用规则，不代表所有示例都应放入同一界面。", "size": 12, "color": "#999999", "weight": 400, "font": "PingFang SC"}]}